  "result": "Perfect! All 49 tests pass. I've added:\n\n**New error codes in src/errors.js:**\n- `LINE_NOT_FOUND` \u2014 That SKU is not on this invoice\n- `NOT_DRAFT` \u2014 Cannot modify an invoice that is not in draft status\n\n**New functions in src/invoices.js:**\n\n1. **`addLine(invoice, { sku, qty })`**\n   - Adds a new line at the end of the invoice\n   - If the SKU already exists, increases that line's quantity instead\n   - Validates qty (must be positive integer) and SKU existence\n   - Refuses to modify non-draft invoices (returns `NOT_DRAFT`)\n   - Returns `ok(newInvoice)` or a fail result\n\n2. **`removeLine(invoice, sku)`**\n   - Removes a line by SKU from the invoice\n   - Returns `LINE_NOT_FOUND` if SKU isn't on the invoice\n   - Returns `NO_LINES` if it would remove the last line\n   - Returns `NOT_DRAFT` if trying to modify a non-draft invoice\n   - Returns `ok(newInvoice)` on success\n\n**New tests (14 total):**\n- addLine: new line addition, qty increase, validation errors (QTY_INVALID, UNKNOWN_SKU, NOT_DRAFT), immutability, property preservation\n- removeLine: line removal, error cases (LINE_NOT_FOUND, NO_LINES, NOT_DRAFT), immutability, property preservation\n\nBoth functions maintain immutability\u2014they create new invoice objects and arrays without mutating the originals.",
